<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset - Asentista's Bakery</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f5ede6; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { background: #2B1B15; color: #fff; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 4px solid #FFAE34; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.8rem; font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #FFAE34; }
        .header p { margin: 0; color: #EDE0D4; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .body { padding: 2.5rem 2rem; }
        .body p { color: #4a3728; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .btn-reset { display: inline-block; background: #FFAE34; color: #2B1B15; padding: 0.85rem 2rem; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
        .url-box { background: #fdfaf7; border: 1px solid #e8d8c8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #7a5c4f; word-break: break-all; margin-top: 1rem; font-family: monospace; }
        .footer { background: #fdfaf7; padding: 1.5rem 2rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8a7a72; border-top: 1px solid rgba(43,27,21,0.08); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Asentista's Bakery</h1>
            <p>Sibulan Commercial Center, Negros Oriental</p>
        </div>

        <div class="body">
            <p>Hello, <strong>{{ user.name }}</strong>,</p>

            <p>We received a request to reset the password for your Asentista's Bakery account associated with <strong>{{ user.email }}</strong>.</p>

            <p>Click the button below to choose a new password. This link will expire in <strong>{{ expiresIn }}</strong>.</p>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{ resetUrl }}" class="btn-reset">Reset My Password</a>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #7a5c4f;">If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste the following link into your browser:</p>
            <div class="url-box">{{ resetUrl }}</div>

            <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #9a8a82;">If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your account remains secure and no changes were made.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Asentista's Bakery. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>0994-005-8425 &bull; hello@asentista.com</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
